7ce8c9-6e69-440e-8664-a9a2fab03ee3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":vimhelp plugin add thinca/vim-quickrun","ts":"1616502668.109000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yh/wS"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"E149: 残念ですが quickrun-syntax-option にはヘルプがありません","ts":"1616502649.108600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"dfb5cda9-429c-4ce3-8c2b-693c416eb6da","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":h quickrun-syntax-option","ts":"1616502649.108500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dgL/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8cb25216-3bcd-4df4-a5d9-ee2147b3256d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@U03C71D7H\u003e （結果上手くいったので細かい話になっちゃうんですが）QuickRunで以下の設定をして、grepの引数の `$\"` の `$` をエスケープしないと動かない理由って何か分かるでしょうか\n```\\ 'eslint' : {\n\\   'command': 'eslint',\n\\   'exec': ['yarn run --silent %C --quiet --format unix --ext .ts,.tsx %a 2\u0026gt;/dev/null | grep -v -e \"^\\s*$\" -e \"^\\d\\+\\sproblems$\"'],\n\\   'outputter' : 'quickfix',\n\\   'outputter/quickfix/errorformat' : '%f:%l:%c:%m',\n\\ },```\nで `:QuickRun eslint -args src` した結果grepにうまく引数が渡らなくて\nquickfix_titleが `yarn run --silent eslint --quiet --format unix --ext .ts,.tsx src 2\u0026gt;/dev/null | grep -v -e \"^\\s* \"^\\d\\+\\sproblems`\nになります。\n`grep -v -e \"^\\s*\\$\" -e \"^\\d\\+\\sproblems\\$\"` したら期待通りになったんですが、シングルクォートの文字列でescsapeしないといけないことってあったっけなって思って。","ts":"1616502592.108300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xG0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1948a3e5-f86d-463d-a317-937a57cb1457","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"見逃してたけどこれバグっぽいからあとで確認してみます\n\u003c@U7A37H0S3\u003e 気付いてなくてすみません\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1616300775057800\u003e","ts":"1616478683.105500","attachments":[{"fallback":"[March 20th, 2021 9:26 PM] oppara: fzf-preview の件、とりあえず解決。\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1616123361008800\u003e\n\n`fzf_preview#remote#process#get_default_processes(‘open-file’, ‘coc’)` で取得できる値が `remote` や `rpc` の値になってるっぽいです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim/blob/main/doc/fzf_preview_vim.txt#L674-L682\u003e\n\nなので、ベタ書きすれば動きました :smile:\n\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim/blob/main/doc/fzf_preview_vim.txt#L602\u003e\n```\nlet g:fzf_preview_custom_processes = {\n  \\ ‘open-file’: {\n    \\ ‘ctrl-o’: ‘OpenFileCtrlO’,\n    \\ ‘ctrl-q’: ‘OpenFileCtrlQ’,\n    \\ ‘ctrl-t’: ‘OpenFileCtrlT’,\n    \\ ‘ctrl-v’: ‘OpenFileCtrlV’,\n    \\ ‘ctrl-s’: ‘OpenFileCtrlX’,\n    \\ ‘enter’: ‘OpenFileEnter’\n    \\}\n  \\}\n```","id":1,"author_id":"U7A37H0S3","author_name":"oppara","author_subname":"oppara","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U7A37H0S3","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e10b04f86a16e4f29516696d666ff025.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0007-48.png","text":"fzf-preview の件、とりあえず解決。\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1616123361008800\u003e\n\n`fzf_preview#remote#process#get_default_processes(‘open-file’, ‘coc’)` で取得できる値が `remote` や `rpc` の値になってるっぽいです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim/blob/main/doc/fzf_preview_vim.txt#L674-L682\u003e\n\nなので、ベタ書きすれば動きました :smile:\n\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim/blob/main/doc/fzf_preview_vim.txt#L602\u003e\n```\nlet g:fzf_preview_custom_processes = {\n  \\ ‘open-file’: {\n    \\ ‘ctrl-o’: ‘OpenFileCtrlO’,\n    \\ ‘ctrl-q’: ‘OpenFileCtrlQ’,\n    \\ ‘ctrl-t’: ‘OpenFileCtrlT’,\n    \\ ‘ctrl-v’: ‘OpenFileCtrlV’,\n    \\ ‘ctrl-s’: ‘OpenFileCtrlX’,\n    \\ ‘enter’: ‘OpenFileEnter’\n    \\}\n  \\}\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #question","ts":1616300775.057800,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1616300775057800","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1616300775057800"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"man-bowing::skin-tone-2","count":1,"users":["U7A37H0S3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WJsy"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01S254C518","text":"\u003c@U01S254C518\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1616431748.104900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
